{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "KJV1769",
  "book_code": "JOB",
  "chapter": 11,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:JOB.11.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then answered Zophar the Naamathite, and said,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:JOB.11.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Should not the multitude of words be answered? and should a man full of talk be justified?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:JOB.11.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Should thy lies make men hold their peace? and when thou mockest, shall no man make thee ashamed?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:JOB.11.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For thou hast said, My doctrine ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " pure, and I am clean in thine eyes.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:JOB.11.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But oh that God would speak, and open his lips against thee;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:JOB.11.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And that he would shew thee the secrets of wisdom, that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "they are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " double to that which is! Know therefore that God exacteth of thee ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "less",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " than thine iniquity ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "deserveth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:JOB.11.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Canst thou by searching find out God? canst thou find out the Almighty unto perfection?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:JOB.11.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "It is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " as high as heaven; what canst thou do? deeper than hell; what canst thou know?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:JOB.11.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The measure thereof ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " longer than the earth, and broader than the sea.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:JOB.11.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If he cut off, and shut up, or gather together, then who can hinder him?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:JOB.11.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For he knoweth vain men: he seeth wickedness also; will he not then consider ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:JOB.11.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For vain man would be wise, though man be born ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "like",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a wild ass’s colt.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:JOB.11.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If thou prepare thine heart, and stretch out thine hands toward him;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:JOB.11.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If iniquity ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in thine hand, put it far away, and let not wickedness dwell in thy tabernacles.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:JOB.11.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For then shalt thou lift up thy face without spot; yea, thou shalt be stedfast, and shalt not fear:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:JOB.11.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Because thou shalt forget ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "thy",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " misery, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " remember ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " as waters ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " pass away:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:JOB.11.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "thine",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " age shall be clearer than the noonday; thou shalt shine forth, thou shalt be as the morning.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:JOB.11.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt be secure, because there is hope; yea, thou shalt dig ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "about thee, and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thou shalt take thy rest in safety.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:JOB.11.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Also thou shalt lie down, and none shall make ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "thee",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " afraid; yea, many shall make suit unto thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:JOB.11.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But the eyes of the wicked shall fail, and they shall not escape, and their hope ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be as",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the giving up of the ghost.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
